ing, memory, permissions, hooks, background commands, MCP integration, and subagent support. Features interactive REPL sessions and one-shot run modes.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-31\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\n      \"GitHub\"\n    ],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\n      \"Terminal-first coding agent for developers\",\n      \"Built for the part of AI coding that happens inside a real repository\",\n      \"Follows the core Claude Code experience while backing into any OpenAI-compatible model\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"plumb-mcp\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/tathagat22/plumb-mcp\",\n    \"description\": \"A local Figma MCP server with no REST rate limits, no metered tool-call quotas, and a verification loop. A drop-in alternative to Figma's Dev Mode MCP and Framelink for Claude Code, Cursor, and Windsurf that works on every plan including Free.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-23\",\n    \"category\": \"MCP server\",\n    \"sources\": [\n      \"GitHub\"\n    ],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\n      \"Local Figma MCP server - no REST rate limits, no metered tool-call quotas\",\n      \"Drop-in alternative to Figma's Dev Mode MCP\",\n      \"Works on every plan including Free\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"agentpet\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/ntd4996/agentpet\",\n    \"description\": \"A native macOS menu bar app with a desktop pet that monitors your AI coding agents (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI) in real time. Provides visual feedback and monitoring for terminal-based AI coding workflows.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-31\",\n    \"category\": \"Desktop monitoring tool\",\n    \"sources\": [\n      \"GitHub\"\n    ],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\n      \"A desktop pet that monitors your AI coding agents in real time\",\n      \"Native macOS menu bar app for monitoring Claude Code, Codex, and Gemini CLI\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"MimoAgent\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.c